# Title: DriverQuery.EXE Execution
# ID: a20def93-0709-4eae-9bd2-31206e21e6b2
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-01-19
# Tags: attack.discovery
# Description: Detect usage of the "driverquery" utility. Which can be used to perform reconnaissance on installed drivers
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*driverquery.exe") OR (process_name="drvqry.exe")) AND NOT ((((parent_process_path="*\\cscript.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\mshta.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\regsvr32.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\rundll32.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\wscript.exe")) OR ((parent_process_path="*\\AppData\\Local\\*" OR parent_process_path="*\\Users\\Public\\*" OR parent_process_path="*\\Windows\\Temp\\*")))))
